'''Timberwood''' is a crafting resource obtained by chopping down trees in the [[Deep North]] biome. It is used for crafting Nord-tier weapons and for building [[Timber Structures|Timber]] and [[Scalewood Structures]].

== Availability ==
* Chopping the logs of felled fir and pine trees. Each fir log half gives ten drops, each with a 20% chance to be Timberwood (the rest are [[Wood]] and Timberwood Cones). Each pine log half gives fifteen drops, each with a 33% chance to be Timberwood (the rest are Wood).
* Destroying pine tree stumps (two Timberwood each) and other Deep North stumps (one to six each). Fir tree stumps drop only Wood.
* Picking up Branches, one Timberwood each; they respawn after 240 minutes.
* Destroying Piles of Rubble, Hexahedric Pulp, Wardrobe Shafts and some furniture props.

